{"1":{"w":[{"c":"نٓ","d":"noon","e":"Nun"},{"c":"وَالْقَلَمِ","d":"wal-qalami","e":"By the pen"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and what"},{"c":"يَسْطُرُونَ","d":"yasṭurūna","e":"they write"}],"a":{"g":"Nun. By the pen and what they inscribe,"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"أَنْتَ","d":"anta","e":"you (are)"},{"c":"بِنِعْمَةِ","d":"biniʿ'mati","e":"by (the) Grace"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"بِمَجْنُونٍ","d":"bimajnūnin","e":"a madman"}],"a":{"g":"You are not, [O Muhammad], by the favor of your Lord, a madman."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"لَكَ","d":"laka","e":"for you"},{"c":"لَأَجْرًا","d":"la-ajran","e":"surely (is) a reward"},{"c":"غَيْرَ","d":"ghayra","e":"without"},{"c":"مَمْنُونٍ","d":"mamnūnin","e":"end"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, for you is a reward uninterrupted."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّكَ","d":"wa-innaka","e":"And indeed you"},{"c":"لَعَلَى","d":"laʿalā","e":"surely (are)"},{"c":"خُلُقٍ","d":"khuluqin","e":"(of) a moral character"},{"c":"عَظِيمٍ","d":"ʿaẓīmin","e":"great"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, you are of a great moral character."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"فَسَتُبْصِرُ","d":"fasatub'ṣiru","e":"So soon you will see"},{"c":"وَيُبْصِرُونَ","d":"wayub'ṣirūna","e":"and they will see"}],"a":{"g":"So you will see and they will see"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"بِأَيِّيكُمُ","d":"bi-ayyikumu","e":"Which of you"},{"c":"الْمَفْتُونُ","d":"l-maftūnu","e":"(is) the afflicted one"}],"a":{"g":"Which of you is the afflicted [by a devil]."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"رَبَّكَ","d":"rabbaka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"أَعْلَمُ","d":"aʿlamu","e":"(is) most knowing"},{"c":"بِمَنْ","d":"biman","e":"of (he) who"},{"c":"ضَلَّ","d":"ḍalla","e":"has strayed"},{"c":"عَنْ","d":"ʿan","e":"from"},{"c":"سَبِيلِهِ","d":"sabīlihi","e":"His way"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"and He"},{"c":"أَعْلَمُ","d":"aʿlamu","e":"(is) most knowing"},{"c":"بِالْمُهْتَدِينَ","d":"bil-muh'tadīna","e":"of the guided ones"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who has gone astray from His way, and He is most knowing of the [rightly] guided."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"So (do) not"},{"c":"تُطِعِ","d":"tuṭiʿi","e":"obey"},{"c":"الْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"l-mukadhibīna","e":"the deniers"}],"a":{"g":"Then do not obey the deniers."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"وَدُّوا","d":"waddū","e":"They wish"},{"c":"لَوْ","d":"law","e":"that"},{"c":"تُدْهِنُ","d":"tud'hinu","e":"you should compromise"},{"c":"فَيُدْهِنُونَ","d":"fayud'hinūna","e":"so they would compromise"}],"a":{"g":"They wish that you would soften [in your position], so they would soften [toward you]."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And (do) not"},{"c":"تُطِعْ","d":"tuṭiʿ","e":"obey"},{"c":"كُلَّ","d":"kulla","e":"every"},{"c":"حَلَّافٍ","d":"ḥallāfin","e":"habitual swearer"},{"c":"مَهِينٍ","d":"mahīnin","e":"worthless"}],"a":{"g":"And do not obey every worthless habitual swearer"}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"هَمَّازٍ","d":"hammāzin","e":"Defamer"},{"c":"مَشَّاءٍ","d":"mashāin","e":"going about"},{"c":"بِنَمِيمٍ","d":"binamīmin","e":"with malicious gossip"}],"a":{"g":"[And] scorner, going about with malicious gossip -"}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"مَنَّاعٍ","d":"mannāʿin","e":"A preventer"},{"c":"لِلْخَيْرِ","d":"lil'khayri","e":"of (the) good"},{"c":"مُعْتَدٍ","d":"muʿ'tadin","e":"transgressor"},{"c":"أَثِيمٍ","d":"athīmin","e":"sinful"}],"a":{"g":"A preventer of good, transgressing and sinful,"}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"عُتُلٍّ","d":"ʿutullin","e":"Cruel"},{"c":"بَعْدَ","d":"baʿda","e":"after"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"(all) that"},{"c":"زَنِيمٍ","d":"zanīmin","e":"utterly useless"}],"a":{"g":"Cruel, moreover, and an illegitimate pretender."}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"Because"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"(he) is"},{"c":"ذَا","d":"dhā","e":"a possessor"},{"c":"مَالٍ","d":"mālin","e":"(of) wealth"},{"c":"وَبَنِينَ","d":"wabanīna","e":"and children"}],"a":{"g":"Because he is a possessor of wealth and children,"}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"When"},{"c":"تُتْلَى","d":"tut'lā","e":"are recited"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"to him"},{"c":"ءَايَاتُنَا","d":"āyātunā","e":"Our Verses"},{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"he says"},{"c":"أَسَاطِيرُ","d":"asāṭīru","e":"Stories"},{"c":"الْأَوَّلِينَ","d":"l-awalīna","e":"(of) the former (people)"}],"a":{"g":"When Our verses are recited to him, he says, \"Legends of the former peoples.\""}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"سَنَسِمُهُ","d":"sanasimuhu","e":"We will brand him"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"الْخُرْطُومِ","d":"l-khur'ṭūmi","e":"the snout"}],"a":{"g":"We will brand him upon the snout."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"بَلَوْنَاهُمْ","d":"balawnāhum","e":"have tried them"},{"c":"كَمَا","d":"kamā","e":"as"},{"c":"بَلَوْنَا","d":"balawnā","e":"We tried"},{"c":"أَصْحَابَ","d":"aṣḥāba","e":"(the) companions"},{"c":"الْجَنَّةِ","d":"l-janati","e":"(of) the garden"},{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"when"},{"c":"أَقْسَمُوا","d":"aqsamū","e":"they swore"},{"c":"لَيَصْرِمُنَّهَا","d":"layaṣrimunnahā","e":"to pluck its fruit"},{"c":"مُصْبِحِينَ","d":"muṣ'biḥīna","e":"(in the) morning"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We have tried them as We tried the companions of the garden, when they swore to cut its fruit in the [early] morning"}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And not"},{"c":"يَسْتَثْنُونَ","d":"yastathnūna","e":"making exception"}],"a":{"g":"Without making exception."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"فَطَافَ","d":"faṭāfa","e":"So there came"},{"c":"عَلَيْهَا","d":"ʿalayhā","e":"upon it"},{"c":"طَائِفٌ","d":"ṭāifun","e":"a visitation"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"وَهُمْ","d":"wahum","e":"while they"},{"c":"نَائِمُونَ","d":"nāimūna","e":"were asleep"}],"a":{"g":"So there came upon the garden an affliction from your Lord while they were asleep."}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَصْبَحَتْ","d":"fa-aṣbaḥat","e":"So it became"},{"c":"كَالصَّرِيمِ","d":"kal-ṣarīmi","e":"as if reaped"}],"a":{"g":"And it became as though reaped."}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"فَتَنَادَوْا","d":"fatanādaw","e":"And they called one another"},{"c":"مُصْبِحِينَ","d":"muṣ'biḥīna","e":"(at) morning"}],"a":{"g":"And they called one another at morning,"}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"أَنِ","d":"ani","e":"That"},{"c":"اغْدُوا","d":"igh'dū","e":"Go early"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"to"},{"c":"حَرْثِكُمْ","d":"ḥarthikum","e":"your crop"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you would"},{"c":"صَارِمِينَ","d":"ṣārimīna","e":"pluck (the) fruit"}],"a":{"g":"[Saying], \"Go early to your crop if you would cut the fruit.\""}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"فَانْطَلَقُوا","d":"fa-inṭalaqū","e":"So they went"},{"c":"وَهُمْ","d":"wahum","e":"while they"},{"c":"يَتَخَافَتُونَ","d":"yatakhāfatūna","e":"lowered (their) voices"}],"a":{"g":"So they set out, while lowering their voices,"}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"That"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يَدْخُلَنَّهَا","d":"yadkhulannahā","e":"will enter it"},{"c":"الْيَوْمَ","d":"l-yawma","e":"today"},{"c":"عَلَيْكُمْ","d":"ʿalaykum","e":"upon you"},{"c":"مِسْكِينٌ","d":"mis'kīnun","e":"any poor person"}],"a":{"g":"[Saying], \"There will surely not enter it today upon you [any] poor person.\""}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"وَغَدَوْا","d":"waghadaw","e":"And they went early"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"with"},{"c":"حَرْدٍ","d":"ḥardin","e":"determination"},{"c":"قَادِرِينَ","d":"qādirīna","e":"able"}],"a":{"g":"And they went early in determination, [assuming themselves] able."}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَمَّا","d":"falammā","e":"But when"},{"c":"رَأَوْهَا","d":"ra-awhā","e":"they saw it"},{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"they said"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed we"},{"c":"لَضَالُّونَ","d":"laḍāllūna","e":"(are) surely lost"}],"a":{"g":"But when they saw it, they said, \"Indeed, we are lost;"}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"We"},{"c":"مَحْرُومُونَ","d":"maḥrūmūna","e":"(are) deprived"}],"a":{"g":"Rather, we have been deprived.\""}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"Said"},{"c":"أَوْسَطُهُمْ","d":"awsaṭuhum","e":"(the) most moderate of them"},{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Did not"},{"c":"أَقُلْ","d":"aqul","e":"I tell"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"you"},{"c":"لَوْلَا","d":"lawlā","e":"Why not"},{"c":"تُسَبِّحُونَ","d":"tusabbiḥūna","e":"you glorify (Allah)"}],"a":{"g":"The most moderate of them said, \"Did I not say to you, 'Why do you not exalt [Allah]?' \""}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"سُبْحَانَ","d":"sub'ḥāna","e":"Glory be"},{"c":"رَبِّنَا","d":"rabbinā","e":"(to) our Lord!"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed we"},{"c":"كُنَّا","d":"kunnā","e":"[we] were"},{"c":"ظَالِمِينَ","d":"ẓālimīna","e":"wrongdoers"}],"a":{"g":"They said, \"Exalted is our Lord! Indeed, we were wrongdoers.\""}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَقْبَلَ","d":"fa-aqbala","e":"Then approached"},{"c":"بَعْضُهُمْ","d":"baʿḍuhum","e":"some of them"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"to"},{"c":"بَعْضٍ","d":"baʿḍin","e":"others"},{"c":"يَتَلَاوَمُونَ","d":"yatalāwamūna","e":"blaming each other"}],"a":{"g":"Then they approached one another, blaming each other."}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"يَاوَيْلَنَا","d":"yāwaylanā","e":"O woe to us!"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed we"},{"c":"كُنَّا","d":"kunnā","e":"[we] were"},{"c":"طَاغِينَ","d":"ṭāghīna","e":"transgressors"}],"a":{"g":"They said, \"O woe to us; indeed we were transgressors."}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"عَسَى","d":"ʿasā","e":"Perhaps"},{"c":"رَبُّنَا","d":"rabbunā","e":"our Lord"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"[that]"},{"c":"يُبْدِلَنَا","d":"yub'dilanā","e":"will substitute for us"},{"c":"خَيْرًا","d":"khayran","e":"a better"},{"c":"مِنْهَا","d":"min'hā","e":"than it"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed we"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"رَبِّنَا","d":"rabbinā","e":"our Lord"},{"c":"رَاغِبُونَ","d":"rāghibūna","e":"turn devoutly"}],"a":{"g":"Perhaps our Lord will substitute for us [one] better than it. Indeed, we are toward our Lord desirous.\""}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"Such"},{"c":"الْعَذَابُ","d":"l-ʿadhābu","e":"(is) the punishment"},{"c":"وَلَعَذَابُ","d":"walaʿadhābu","e":"And surely the punishment"},{"c":"الْءَاخِرَةِ","d":"l-ākhirati","e":"(of) the Hereafter"},{"c":"أَكْبَرُ","d":"akbaru","e":"(is) greater"},{"c":"لَوْ","d":"law","e":"if"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"know"}],"a":{"g":"Such is the punishment [of this world]. And the punishment of the Hereafter is greater, if they only knew."}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","d":"lil'muttaqīna","e":"for the righteous"},{"c":"عِنْدَ","d":"ʿinda","e":"with"},{"c":"رَبِّهِمْ","d":"rabbihim","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"جَنَّاتِ","d":"jannāti","e":"(are) Gardens"},{"c":"النَّعِيمِ","d":"l-naʿīmi","e":"(of) Delight"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, for the righteous with their Lord are the Gardens of Pleasure."}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"أَفَنَجْعَلُ","d":"afanajʿalu","e":"Then will We treat"},{"c":"الْمُسْلِمِينَ","d":"l-mus'limīna","e":"the Muslims"},{"c":"كَالْمُجْرِمِينَ","d":"kal-muj'rimīna","e":"like the criminals"}],"a":{"g":"Then will We treat the Muslims like the criminals?"}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"What"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"(is) for you"},{"c":"كَيْفَ","d":"kayfa","e":"How"},{"c":"تَحْكُمُونَ","d":"taḥkumūna","e":"(do) you judge"}],"a":{"g":"What is [the matter] with you? How do you judge?"}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"(is) for you"},{"c":"كِتَابٌ","d":"kitābun","e":"a book"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"wherein"},{"c":"تَدْرُسُونَ","d":"tadrusūna","e":"you learn"}],"a":{"g":"Or do you have a scripture in which you learn"}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"That"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"therein"},{"c":"لَمَا","d":"lamā","e":"what"},{"c":"تَخَيَّرُونَ","d":"takhayyarūna","e":"you choose"}],"a":{"g":"That indeed for you is whatever you choose?"}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"(do) you have"},{"c":"أَيْمَانٌ","d":"aymānun","e":"oaths"},{"c":"عَلَيْنَا","d":"ʿalaynā","e":"from us"},{"c":"بَالِغَةٌ","d":"bālighatun","e":"reaching"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"يَوْمِ","d":"yawmi","e":"(the) Day"},{"c":"الْقِيَامَةِ","d":"l-qiyāmati","e":"(of) the Resurrection"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"That"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"لَمَا","d":"lamā","e":"(is) what"},{"c":"تَحْكُمُونَ","d":"taḥkumūna","e":"you judge"}],"a":{"g":"Or do you have oaths [binding] upon Us, extending until the Day of Resurrection, that indeed for you is whatever you judge?"}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"سَلْهُمْ","d":"salhum","e":"Ask them"},{"c":"أَيُّهُمْ","d":"ayyuhum","e":"which of them"},{"c":"بِذَلِكَ","d":"bidhālika","e":"for that"},{"c":"زَعِيمٌ","d":"zaʿīmun","e":"(is) responsible"}],"a":{"g":"Ask them which of them, for that [claim], is responsible."}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"(do) they have"},{"c":"شُرَكَاءُ","d":"shurakāu","e":"partners"},{"c":"فَلْيَأْتُوا","d":"falyatū","e":"Then let them bring"},{"c":"بِشُرَكَائِهِمْ","d":"bishurakāihim","e":"their partners"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they are"},{"c":"صَادِقِينَ","d":"ṣādiqīna","e":"truthful"}],"a":{"g":"Or do they have partners? Then let them bring their partners, if they should be truthful."}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"يُكْشَفُ","d":"yuk'shafu","e":"will be uncovered"},{"c":"عَنْ","d":"ʿan","e":"from"},{"c":"سَاقٍ","d":"sāqin","e":"the shin"},{"c":"وَيُدْعَوْنَ","d":"wayud'ʿawna","e":"and they will be called"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"السُّجُودِ","d":"l-sujūdi","e":"prostrate"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"but not"},{"c":"يَسْتَطِيعُونَ","d":"yastaṭīʿūna","e":"they will be able"}],"a":{"g":"The Day the shin will be uncovered and they are invited to prostration but the disbelievers will not be able,"}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"خَاشِعَةً","d":"khāshiʿatan","e":"Humbled"},{"c":"أَبْصَارُهُمْ","d":"abṣāruhum","e":"their eyes"},{"c":"تَرْهَقُهُمْ","d":"tarhaquhum","e":"will cover them"},{"c":"ذِلَّةٌ","d":"dhillatun","e":"humiliation"},{"c":"وَقَدْ","d":"waqad","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they were"},{"c":"يُدْعَوْنَ","d":"yud'ʿawna","e":"called"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"السُّجُودِ","d":"l-sujūdi","e":"prostrate"},{"c":"وَهُمْ","d":"wahum","e":"while they"},{"c":"سَالِمُونَ","d":"sālimūna","e":"(were) sound"}],"a":{"g":"Their eyes humbled, humiliation will cover them. And they used to be invited to prostration while they were sound."}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"فَذَرْنِي","d":"fadharnī","e":"So leave Me"},{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"and whoever"},{"c":"يُكَذِّبُ","d":"yukadhibu","e":"denies"},{"c":"بِهَذَا","d":"bihādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"الْحَدِيثِ","d":"l-ḥadīthi","e":"Statement"},{"c":"سَنَسْتَدْرِجُهُمْ","d":"sanastadrijuhum","e":"We will progressively lead them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"حَيْثُ","d":"ḥaythu","e":"where"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"they know"}],"a":{"g":"So leave Me, [O Muhammad], with [the matter of] whoever denies the Qur'an. We will progressively lead them [to punishment] from where they do not know."}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"وَأُمْلِي","d":"wa-um'lī","e":"And I will give respite"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"to them"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"كَيْدِي","d":"kaydī","e":"My plan"},{"c":"مَتِينٌ","d":"matīnun","e":"(is) firm"}],"a":{"g":"And I will give them time. Indeed, My plan is firm."}},"46":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"تَسْءَلُهُمْ","d":"tasaluhum","e":"you ask them"},{"c":"أَجْرًا","d":"ajran","e":"a payment"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"so they"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"مَغْرَمٍ","d":"maghramin","e":"(the) debt"},{"c":"مُثْقَلُونَ","d":"muth'qalūna","e":"(are) burdened"}],"a":{"g":"Or do you ask of them a payment, so they are by debt burdened down?"}},"47":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"عِنْدَهُمُ","d":"ʿindahumu","e":"(is) with them"},{"c":"الْغَيْبُ","d":"l-ghaybu","e":"the unseen"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"so they"},{"c":"يَكْتُبُونَ","d":"yaktubūna","e":"write it"}],"a":{"g":"Or have they [knowledge of] the unseen, so they write [it] down?"}},"48":{"w":[{"c":"فَاصْبِرْ","d":"fa-iṣ'bir","e":"So be patient"},{"c":"لِحُكْمِ","d":"liḥuk'mi","e":"for (the) decision"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and (do) not"},{"c":"تَكُنْ","d":"takun","e":"be"},{"c":"كَصَاحِبِ","d":"kaṣāḥibi","e":"like (the) companion"},{"c":"الْحُوتِ","d":"l-ḥūti","e":"(of) the fish"},{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"when"},{"c":"نَادَى","d":"nādā","e":"he called out"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"while he"},{"c":"مَكْظُومٌ","d":"makẓūmun","e":"(was) distressed"}],"a":{"g":"Then be patient for the decision of your Lord, [O Muhammad], and be not like the companion of the fish when he called out while he was distressed."}},"49":{"w":[{"c":"لَوْلَا","d":"lawlā","e":"If not"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"تَدَارَكَهُ","d":"tadārakahu","e":"overtook him"},{"c":"نِعْمَةٌ","d":"niʿ'matun","e":"a Favor"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"رَبِّهِ","d":"rabbihi","e":"his Lord"},{"c":"لَنُبِذَ","d":"lanubidha","e":"surely he would have been thrown"},{"c":"بِالْعَرَاءِ","d":"bil-ʿarāi","e":"onto (the) naked shore"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"while he"},{"c":"مَذْمُومٌ","d":"madhmūmun","e":"(was) blamed"}],"a":{"g":"If not that a favor from his Lord overtook him, he would have been thrown onto the naked shore while he was censured."}},"50":{"w":[{"c":"فَاجْتَبَاهُ","d":"fa-ij'tabāhu","e":"But chose him"},{"c":"رَبُّهُ","d":"rabbuhu","e":"his Lord"},{"c":"فَجَعَلَهُ","d":"fajaʿalahu","e":"and made him"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الصَّالِحِينَ","d":"l-ṣāliḥīna","e":"the righteous"}],"a":{"g":"And his Lord chose him and made him of the righteous."}},"51":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"يَكَادُ","d":"yakādu","e":"would almost"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"لَيُزْلِقُونَكَ","d":"layuz'liqūnaka","e":"surely make you slip"},{"c":"بِأَبْصَارِهِمْ","d":"bi-abṣārihim","e":"with their eyes"},{"c":"لَمَّا","d":"lammā","e":"when"},{"c":"سَمِعُوا","d":"samiʿū","e":"they hear"},{"c":"الذِّكْرَ","d":"l-dhik'ra","e":"the Message"},{"c":"وَيَقُولُونَ","d":"wayaqūlūna","e":"and they say"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed he"},{"c":"لَمَجْنُونٌ","d":"lamajnūnun","e":"(is) surely mad"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, those who disbelieve would almost make you slip with their eyes when they hear the message, and they say, \"Indeed, he is mad.\""}},"52":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"it (is)"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"ذِكْرٌ","d":"dhik'run","e":"a Reminder"},{"c":"لِلْعَالَمِينَ","d":"lil'ʿālamīna","e":"to the worlds"}],"a":{"g":"But it is not except a reminder to the worlds."}}}